	SHD I		/NEITHER
	4300
	JMP QAG		/CR. MOVE X AND Y COORDINATE
	JMP QAP		/ISPLAY CHAR
	JMP QAH		/PICK UP NEXT CHAR
	JMP QAP		/TO HERE IF DISPLAYING ANSWER BUFR
	SRO I	/SWITCH TO DISPLAY CURSOR. EITHER 0000 OR 7777
	0		/IFXR4=XR5, THEN SWITCH=7777
	JMP QAF
			/QUESTION MODE
QAI,	LDH I 5
