	JMP QAQ		/74 BACK PTR UP BY 1
	JMP QAQ		/34 ^
	LDA I		/OK. STORE IT
	0
	STH 4
	JMP QARFSH	/REDISPLAY
QAL,	LDH 4		/TO HERE IF RUBBOUT OR <
